e walks with Sara through her daily chores while searching for the topic for her next column. Her editor pressures her and Tamara dives into the night with her friends looking for new experiences. The three friends reconnect with the city and its parallel worlds.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/d05718f7-ae13-4e28-a7b4-1a5d5dffb92a.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:22776":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Tamara returns to the school she attended as a child and overhears the Literature lesson Sara is teaching to a group of students. She walks with Sara through her daily chores while searching for the topic for her next column. Her editor pressures her and Tamara dives into the night with her friends looking for new experiences. The three friends reconnect with the city and its parallel worlds.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/d05718f7-ae13-4e28-a7b4-1a5d5dffb92a.webp"}}},"externalMappings":{"tmdb":{"status":"unverified","reason":"missing-distinctive-provider-title"},"tvdb":{"status":"unverified","reason":"missing-distinctive-provider-title"}}},{"number":5,"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Tamara presents a column about affective responsibility; Federico, who overhears, is outraged. Tam and Laura, undercover, attend a workshop about jealousy for polyamorous people while Juana fights with her mother. The friends argue and spend the night apart.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/ecc1cee6-429c-4ffb-aa48-7d6f8694de5d.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:22776":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Tamara presents a column about affective responsibility; Federico, who overhears, is outraged. Tam and Laura, undercover, attend a workshop about jealousy for polyamorous people while Juana fights with her mother. The friends argue and spend the night apart.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/ecc1cee6-429c-4ffb-aa48-7d6f8694de5d.webp"}}},"externalMappings":{"tmdb